#: ../../funding.rst:58
msgid ""
":doc:`Qingpu Enterprise Intelligent Transformation Support Fund, 2026 "
"<funding/qingpu-intelligent-2026>` (2026青浦区企业智能化改造扶持资金 · Grant / "
"reimbursement · Qingpu · No equity) — **Proportion of verified "
